<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnBirthEventToDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnBirthEventToDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnBirthEventToDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Birth life-event → schema:birthDate"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnBirthEventToDate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Extracts a person's birth date by traversing the reified event model: an event with gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeBirth, whose principal Participation (gmeow:participationRole gmeow:roleParticipantPrincipal, gmeow:participationParticipant ?person) and gmeow:eventTime yield ?person schema:birthDate. GMEOW models birth as an event (with place, sources, confidence, participant roles); this downcasts the event's instant to the flat schema:birthDate / vCard BDAY field."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnBirthEventToDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/schema-org.rq> .
