<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnComposeBcp47> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Composes a BCP-47 language tag from a language's gmeow:languageCode and a co-mingled writing system's gmeow:scriptCode (\"ja\" + \"Hani\" → \"ja-Hani\"). The registry tag GMEOW refuses as identity, reconstructed on demand for schema.org consumers and emitted as schema:alternateName. A language with several scripts yields several tags."@en .
