<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnMaximViolationType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Projects a maxim violation to a violation type label. Solver-layer computation (Principle 12). Lossy: the full conversational context is dropped."@en .
