<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnMembershipToJobTitle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnMembershipToJobTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Membership + Role → schema:jobTitle"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnMembershipToJobTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Extracts a job title by traversing the reified relator: a gmeow:Membership (gmeow:membershipMember ?person, gmeow:hasRole ?role) yields ?person schema:jobTitle = the role's label. GMEOW models a job as a role played in a membership; this downcasts the role label to the flat schema:jobTitle / vCard TITLE field."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnMembershipToJobTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/resume.rq> .
