<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnNicknameName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Returns the gmeow:fullName of a PersonName whose gmeow:namePurpose is gmeow:namePurposeNickname, for emission as foaf:nick / vcard:nickname / schema:alternateName. The nickname is a structured name in GMEOW; this downcasts it to the flat nick field."@en .
