<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipantToAttendee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasParticipant → iCalendar ATTENDEE"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipantToAttendee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Downcasts the flat gmeow:hasParticipant shortcut to a bare iCalendar ATTENDEE edge: the participant agent is emitted as ical:attendee on the event. Any reified Participation's role, period, confidence and standpoint are dropped — iCal's ATTENDEE carries none of them."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipantToAttendee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/ical.rq> .
