<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipationToEventRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participation → schema event-role edge"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipationToEventRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Downcasts a reified gmeow:Participation to a flat schema.org event-role edge: the event gains schema:attendee / schema:performer / schema:organizer pointing at the participant, keyed by the participation's gmeow:ParticipantRole. The Participation's period, confidence, evidence and standpoint, and the open role space beyond the three schema roles, are dropped — the flat edge is lossy by design."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnParticipationToEventRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/ical.rq> .
