<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPlaceTypeToClass> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "place-type value → target class"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPlaceTypeToClass> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Maps a gmeow:placeType value individual (e.g. placeTypeCountry) to the target vocabulary class to assert via rdf:type (e.g. schema:Country). The conditional retyping; place types without a target class are dropped."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPlaceTypeToClass> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/bot.rq> .
