<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPosePositionToWktPoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPosePositionToWktPoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPosePositionToWktPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pose position → WKT POINT"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPosePositionToWktPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Projects the translational component of a gmeow:Pose (reached via gmeow:hasPosePosition as SpatialCoordinates) to a GeoSPARQL WKT POINT literal. The orientation component is dropped because GeoSPARQL 1.0/1.1 has no native pose model; heading/bearing may be projected separately to a future GeoPose JSON profile."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPosePositionToWktPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/geosparql.rq> .
