<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Post + Role → schema:roleName (lossy)"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Extracts a role name by traversing the Post: a gmeow:Post (gmeow:postIn ?org, filled by gmeow:Membership gmeow:hasRole ?role) yields the role's label as schema:roleName. GMEOW models a post as a seat independent of its holder; this downcasts the role label to the flat schema:roleName field, collapsing the seat/holder distinction."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/schema-org.rq> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnPostToOrganizationRole> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#expects> _:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnPostToOrganizationRole_expects_0 .
