<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProficiencyToKnownLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProficiencyToKnownLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProficiencyToKnownLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "flatten LanguageProficiency → schema:knowsLanguage"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProficiencyToKnownLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Flattens the reified gmeow:LanguageProficiency relator (agent × language × modality × level) and the flat gmeow:knowsLanguage to schema:knowsLanguage(agent, language). Lossy: the CEFR/ILR/ACTFL level and skill modality are dropped — schema.org has no proficiency model."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProficiencyToKnownLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/schema-org.rq> .
