<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProjectToCMN> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnProjectToCMN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "project expression to CMN staff notation"@en .
