<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "select displayable full name"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Returns an appellation's gmeow:fullName ONLY when gmeow:displayable is not false (deadnames and superseded names are suppressed). Co-equal: every displayable name is emitted; none is privileged as 'primary' — locale-relative selection is left to the consumer."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/foaf.rq> .
