<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayableGender> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayableGender> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayableGender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "select displayable gender identity → gender label"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayableGender> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Returns the rdfs:label of a person's displayable gmeow:GenderIdentity value for emission as schema:gender / foaf:gender. A gmeow:displayable false facet is NEVER emitted — the same suppression contract as a deadname. Lossy and directional: schema.org/FOAF conflate sex and gender, and orientation + sex-assigned-at-birth have no target term, so they are dropped."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectDisplayableGender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/foaf.rq> .
