<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "select displayable endonym place name → schema:name"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Returns the gmeow:fullName of a place's gmeow:PlaceName whose gmeow:namePurpose is gmeow:namePurposeEndonym and which is not gmeow:displayable false — the locale-internal toponym, emitted as schema:name. A projection FRAME choice (endonym-preferred), NOT a primary-name assertion in the canonical model: co-equal exonyms are emitted as schema:alternateName (gmeow:fnSelectExonym), and historical/superseded and competing-standpoint names are dropped."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/schema-org.rq> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#expects> _:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnSelectEndonym_expects_0 .
