_:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnSelectEndonym_expects_0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectEndonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Output> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectEndonym> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#predicate> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectedEndonym> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectEndonym> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectEndonym> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#returns> _:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnSelectEndonym_returns_0 .
_:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnSelectEndonym_returns_0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectEndonym> .
_:l_https___blackcatinformatics_ca_gmeow_fnSelectEndonym_returns_0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "select displayable exonym place name → schema:alternateName"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Returns the gmeow:fullName of a place's gmeow:PlaceName whose gmeow:namePurpose is gmeow:namePurposeExonym and which is not gmeow:displayable false — a name used from outside, emitted as schema:alternateName alongside the endonym selected as schema:name (gmeow:fnSelectEndonym). Lossy: which exonym applies is locale-relative (there may be one per language), and historical/superseded names are dropped."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/schema-org.rq> .
