<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectExonym> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Output> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/outSelectExonym> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#predicate> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectedExonym> .
