<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnSubOrgToDepartment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Projects org hierarchy: a gmeow:Organization that is gmeow:subOrganizationOf a parent is emitted as the parent's schema:department (parent→child, the inverse direction). The department is a first-class sub-organization in GMEOW."@en .
