<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTagToKeyword> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tag label → schema:keywords text"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTagToKeyword> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Extracts the rdfs:label of a gmeow:Tag pointed at by gmeow:hasTag for emission as schema:keywords. Suppresses tags whose gmeow:displayable is false (the same suppression contract as deadnames). Lossy: the tag IRI is lost; only the surface label survives."@en .
