<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTaggingToAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Function> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTaggingToAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProjectionFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTaggingToAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reshape Tagging relator → oa:Annotation"@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTaggingToAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reshapes a reified gmeow:Tagging relator into a W3C Web Annotation (oa:Annotation): the tagged entity becomes oa:hasTarget, the tag becomes oa:hasBody, and oa:motivatedBy is set to oa:tagging. The tagger (gmeow:taggingTagger / gmeow:wasAttributedTo) and temporal scope (gmeow:taggingInterval) are lossy-dropped in the structural projection; a consumer that needs them should use the canonical GMEOW model directly."@en .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/fnTaggingToAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/queries/projections/web-annotation.rq> .
